id: weapon-of-mass-destruction
name: Weapon of Mass Destruction
# A Racial Factor: what it asks for, shown beside its Factor Trait and never enforced (the user's).
requirement: Bio-Android
maximumFactor: 1
prerequisites: N/A
description: >
  Though a biological being you may be, you’re still artificially created, intended as a weapon to point at others and let loose on a rampage. Designed for sheer, unmitigated power, you smash through any obstacle before you.
